   "title": "新兴多智能体系统的模式与问题",
   "title_en": "Patterns and problems in emerging multiagent systems",
   "url": "https://www.anthropic.com/research/multiagent-systems",
   "permalink": "https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsqu0nr604oeroz2rh6b6mqt",
