   "id": "cmsqgeo2e02cvroxvpnycl2zi",
   "title": "AutoGPT 如何用 AGENTS.md 和技能门控管理 AI 生成的拉取请求",
   "title_en": "Your contributors are AI-first now. Is your project？",
   "url": "https://github.blog/open-source/maintainers/your-contributors-are-ai-first-now-is-your-project",
   "permalink": "https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsqgeo2e02cvroxvpnycl2zi",
